# Local backend configuration lives in the repository-root .env.
# The clean admin currently has no authentication, database, email or payment integrations.
# Add only the settings required by each feature as it is rebuilt.
# Real credentials must never be committed. The previous environment is preserved privately
# in tilana-fitness-old/apps/admin/.env; the root .env is a copy for your reference.
# The public website continues to use apps/web/.env and its own .env.example unchanged.
